course: dictionary
lesson: 13669
title: Infrequent: not happening often
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Infrequent means not happening often. It is close to rare, but it is about how often something happens. You can see frequent, which means often, inside the word, and the start of the word turns it into the opposite.
explain: «The buses to the village are infrequent, so we plan our day around them.» The clue is the planning. If buses came all the time, you would not need a plan. So infrequent means there are long gaps between them.
explain: Try the same idea in another sentence: «Aunt Ruth's visits from Canada are infrequent.» Swap in a meaning: "Aunt Ruth's visits happen now and then" still makes sense, so you have the right meaning.
fact: Infrequent means not happening often, with long gaps in between.
fact: Infrequent is the opposite of frequent.
fact: The adverb is infrequently: «The train runs infrequently on Sundays.»
fact: «Infrequent visitors» are people who come only now and then.
fact: In a tally or frequency table, an infrequent value appears only a few times.
exercise: «The buses to the village are infrequent.» What does infrequent mean? | Happening every five minutes | *Not happening often | Very fast | Very noisy
exercise: Which word means the opposite of infrequent? | Heavy | Silent | *Frequent | Late
exercise: Copy the adverb from «The train runs infrequently on Sundays.» | Sundays | train | runs | *infrequently
test: «Aunt Ruth's visits from Canada are infrequent.» Which meaning fits? | *Visits that happen now and then, with long gaps | Free visits | Loud visits with music | Visits every single day
test: In a tally of favourite colours, which value is infrequent? | A colour picked by everyone in the class | *A colour picked by only 2 children | A colour picked by 40 children
exam: Which sentence uses infrequent correctly? | Every single day the bell rings, so it is infrequent | *Eclipses are infrequent, so people wait years to see one | The sun rises infrequently in the morning | My infrequent breakfast is cereal every morning
